{"version":1,"key":"card:637","content":{"id":637,"content":[{"type":"image-gallery","mode":3,"images":[{"id":"a24fc96f-8993-4acf-90dd-360b72579a3d","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/0_db6e1c32-18f1-445e-895a-2fbae4045d74.webp"},{"id":"d26533a0-059e-45c0-8866-8f6283cd267b","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/0%20(1)_aa12cf34-2132-464b-b6c4-312de13f1c6e.webp"},{"id":"b11f976e-431d-444e-af2a-9989604f952f","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/0%20(2)_b5f9d8ae-d781-43c8-967f-7b691f6d48ee.webp"},{"id":"ac83138d-f3f3-499c-bb14-66bc9088d909","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/0%20(3)_0ae38504-c794-4e69-b134-fec1d94b784a.webp"},{"id":"63c74b72-7480-4650-90de-083953eac0b3","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/0%20(4)_3a0ac5ff-256c-409b-8417-d85e5880db8f.webp"},{"id":"250bb182-f1a6-46a2-af7a-9e5f1decdc83","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/0%20(5)_113e4a28-92be-4656-b9ec-3c2f16779b91.webp"}],"height":300,"wider":false,"columnCount":3,"tauContract":"286419ae74266206afa208d4e4067de696bc7f50bae0379b10693da8ca71c38d","collabId":"8e6b813e-0001-419b-bc19-90066dff0a53","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d46074fd-48eb-4b96-92ef-23778ab121c0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在"},{"type":"link","url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/_j7K3KjE748SGD9w2RjheA","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"ab01b31c-7361-466a-a9d9-46abf226d3a7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"微信公众号"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"上看到张朝阳关于拖延的看法：我们想做一件事情的时候会选择拖延，是因为担心做不到，本质原因就是因为不够熟悉，这个时候就是要去想为什么要做这件事情，想表达什么，去收集信息，自言自语的想把东西都关联起来，把脑子热起来，神经元调动起来，这样不熟悉就变为了熟悉，熟悉之后就达到了一个兴奋点，就会存在情绪想做了，就不会等到以后再做。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"18ede22e-df71-4a87-9945-c43ad5e83e05","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"给我的启发是，大脑子热起来 warm up，我很多时候也是，因为不够熟悉，导致迟迟不肯去做，然后去选择做另外的事情，但是我也观察到，一旦我开始做这件事情的时候，事情没有想象的那么难，所以重点就是要开始，为了低门槛的开始，我需要先让脑子热身，做事情钱可以先过下自己的脑子想想，我为什么要做，我应该怎么做，我缺少什么信息，这样热身的过程是低门槛的，不知不觉地开始了这项工作。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"27acbda0-6608-4fb1-8757-0cf8015e763e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在这里切记在选择的过程不要被其他事情夺走了注意力，比如刷资讯，刷视频，让我把这个事情丢在一边，因为很多时候当有多个选项摆在面前的时候，我们总是会选择容易的那个，就像电子大部分会流向电阻最小的那条通路，而刷手机就是阻力最小的，可以放下手机，散散步去在脑中思考这个问题，当这个问题变得熟悉之后，我想我们会马上开始。"}]}],"tags":["随笔","个人成长"],"createTime":1762823995198,"updateTime":1765115149372,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1765115149372},"pluginRenderers":[{"runtimeVersion":1,"manifest":{"id":"tau.image-gallery","name":"图册","version":"0.1.7","categories":["editor"],"keywords":["图册","画廊","图片","gallery"],"apiVersion":1,"format":"cjs","main":"main.js","styles":"main.css","integrity":{"main.js":"847e33cedb240bc588abbaf4c8b12427862ccc76330afaf5212ee5714d508f74","main.css":"d157adbe246c319424247845741efddca6425ce45e7f60e3bd2d5dccc4e697e0"},"formatVersion":3,"platform":"portable","profile":"web-v1","description":"在正文里插入图册，支持横向排版、瀑布流与轮播三种布局。","targets":{"desktop":{"minAppVersion":"0.59.5"},"android":{"minAppVersion":"0.2.7"},"ios":{"minAppVersion":"0.2.7"}}},"entry":"../../plugin-assets/tau.image-gallery/0.1.7/cd5dacdb6f94989a6f05a926c9dae90c9a348fe7bb008e29522cf543877d0156/main.js","styles":"../../plugin-assets/tau.image-gallery/0.1.7/cd5dacdb6f94989a6f05a926c9dae90c9a348fe7bb008e29522cf543877d0156/style.css","nodeTypes":["image-gallery"]}]}